      "title": "devel 镜像缺少 nanobind 预装",
      "body": "docker/devel/Dockerfile 在 builder 阶段安装了 nanobind>=2.9，但实际拉取的预构建镜像 swr.cn-south-1.myhuaweicloud.com/ascendhub/torch-npu-devel:2.13.0-cann9.1.0-910b-manylinux_2_28 中未包含 nanobind，需手动补装",
