      "timestamp": "2026-10-14T16:10:46",
      "problem": "npu-smi 在容器内报错 libc_sec.so: cannot open shared object file",
      "solution": "按 devcontainer.json 的 remoteEnv 配置，设置 LD_LIBRARY_PATH 包含 /usr/local/Ascend/driver/lib64:/usr/local/Ascend/driver/lib64/base:/usr/local/Ascend/driver/lib64/common:/usr/local/Ascend/driver/lib64/driver，npu-smi 恢复正常",
      "source": "步骤2 容器启动"
